  p14-l27  [93 500 524 513]  {NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9}D5. Did you report the basic demographic and geographic characteristics of the annotator population
  p14-l28  [93 513 220 526]  {NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9}that is the source of the data?
  p14-l29  [92 527 209 540]  {NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal 10.9 i}Not applicable. Left blank.
  p14-l30  [291 781 307 794]  {NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9}365
  
