  p2-l101  [306 747 524 761]  {NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9}thermore, each ellipsis example is paired with a
  p2-l102  [306 761 526 774]  {NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9}non-ellipsis version. The first two structures, Sep-
