  p4-l5  [71 507 291 520]  {NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9}the ellipsis as well as the non-ellipsis condition.
  p4-l6  [71 520 289 533]  {NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9}However, in all the other structures, there is a large
  p4-l7  [71 534 291 547]  {NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9}divergence in accuracy between ellipsis and non-
  p4-l8  [71 547 289 561]  {NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9}ellipsis, for both the Davinci-003 and Davinci-002
