  p2-l1  [71 74 291 84]  {NimbusRomNo9L-Medi 10.9 b}Definition 1.{NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal 10.9 i} A{NimbusRomNo9L-MediItal 10.9 b i} probabilistic context-free gram-
  p2-l2  [71 87 291 98]  {NimbusRomNo9L-MediItal 10.9 b i}mar{NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal 10.9 i} (PCFG) is a five-tuple{CMSY10 10.9 i} G{CMR10 10.9} = ({CMSY10 10.9 i}N{CMMI10 10.9 i} ,{CMR10 10.9} Σ{CMMI10 10.9 i},{CMR10 10.9} S{CMMI10 10.9 i},{CMSY10 10.9 i} R{CMMI10 10.9 i}, p{CMR10 10.9}){NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal 10.9 i},
  p2-l3  [71 101 123 111]  {NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal 10.9 i}made up of:
