  p5-l107  [71 750 291 760]  {NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9}and both charts each have two dimensions index-
  p5-l108  [71 763 289 773]  {NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9}ing{CMMI10 10.9 i} N{NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9} and two indexing{CMSY10 10.9 i} N{NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9} . Computing the base
