  p10-l1  [71 74 524 84]  {NimbusRomNo9L-Medi 10.9 b}Definition 14.{NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal 10.9 i} We define{NimbusRomNo9L-MediItal 10.9 b i} semiring matrix multiplication{NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal 10.9 i} as follows. Let{CMMI10 10.9 i} A{NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal 10.9 i} and{CMMI10 10.9 i} B{NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal 10.9 i} be{CMMI10 10.9 i} d{CMSY10 10.9 i} ×{CMMI10 10.9 i} d{NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal 10.9 i} matrices
