  p10-l11  [82 157 524 168]  {NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9}We also define the{NimbusRomNo9L-Medi 10.9 b} zero matrix{NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9},{CMBX10 10.9 b} O{NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9}, over the complete semiring{CMSY10 10.9 i} W{CMR10 10.9} ={CMSY10 10.9 i} ⟨A{CMMI10 10.9 i},{CMSY10 10.9 i} ⊕{CMMI10 10.9 i},{CMSY10 10.9 i} ⊗{CMMI10 10.9 i},{CMBX10 10.9 b} 0{CMMI10 10.9 i},{CMBX10 10.9 b} 1{CMSY10 10.9 i}⟩{NimbusRomNo9L-Regu 10.9}, such that all
