  p13-l23  [89 509 545 520]  {SFRM1200 12}This diagram requires some unpacking. Let us first motivate the relations shown therein,
  p13-l24  [52 523 545 534]  {SFRM1200 12}and then examine the structure of meaning appearing here and how that relates to qualia, dis-
  p13-l25  [52 538 545 549]  {SFRM1200 12}cussed above in earlier sections. After that, we indicate how this system of maps weighs on the
