  p1-l74  [317 410 562 420]  {CMR9 9}MoS{CMR6 6}2{CMR9 9}. The parameters are Fermi velocity{CMMI9 9 i} v{CMMI6 6 i}F{CMR9 9} = 3{CMMI9 9 i}.{CMR9 9}6eV˚{CMMI9 9 i}A{CMR9 9} and
